## Acceptance boundary

Accept episode 5101 as the first training-split collection episode. It has unique identity/hash,
strict row validity, exact reset, six realized actions, stop/turn/reversal coverage, no hidden event,
and reproduces the causal parameter-schedule target under different speeds and durations. This one
episode does not establish dataset coverage, train a model, prove generalization, or justify looking
at the frozen test episodes during model selection.
